## Discovery Session Restrictions

Sessions with discovery intent (`/brainstorm`, `/party-mode`,
discovery-focused conversations) must not edit deployment-triggering
source files or run destructive operations. Discovery output is
documentation only (files under `docs/`, `_bmad-output/`).
Implementation-intent sessions (spawned with a story assignment and task
reference) may edit source files within their ownership boundary.
